ah)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":103.25999999999999,"end":105.32,"text":"Mmm Marie, the paps' disappear","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":105.32,"end":107.77000000000001,"text":"In the round back can't find him nowhere","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":107.77000000000001,"end":110.02000000000001,"text":"Steadily you work flow, everything you know","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":110.02000000000001,"end":116.86,"text":"You know say you nuh stop the time fi a jear","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":116.86,"end":120.0,"text":"Oh, love, no one's ever gonna hurt you, love","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":120.0,"end":122.37,"text":"I'm gonna give you all of my love","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":122.37,"end":125.53,"text":"Nobody matters like you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":125.53,"end":129.16,"text":"So, Rockabye baby, Rockabye","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":129.16,"end":130.46,"text":"I'm gonna rock you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":130.46,"end":133.51,"text":"Rockabye baby, don't you cry","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":133.51,"end":135.09,"text":"Somebody's got you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":135.09,"end":138.03,"text":"Rockabye baby, Rockabye","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":138.03,"end":139.52,"text":"I'm gonna rock you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":139.52,"end":142.57,"text":"Rockabye baby, don't you cry","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":142.57,"end":146.13,"text":"(Oh-badda-bang-bang-bang, alright then)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":146.13,"end":151.03,"text":"Rockabye","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":151.03,"end":177.74,"text":"Rockabye baby","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":177.74,"end":1